#. ja: マメット・エルヴァーン
#. de: Elvaan-Marionette
#. fr: poupée elvaan
#. column 2: wind-up Elvaan
#. column 8: Remarks relating to a certain people's perpetually dour facial expressions are best kept to oneself.<br><br>Use item to acquire the wind-up Elvaan minion.
#. column 9: Wind-up Elvaan
msgctxt "Item:24000:0:0"
msgid "wind-up Elvaan"
msgstr "Заводной эльваан"

#. de: Elvaan-Marionetten
#. fr: poupées elvaans
#. column 0: wind-up Elvaan
#. column 8: Remarks relating to a certain people's perpetually dour facial expressions are best kept to oneself.<br><br>Use item to acquire the wind-up Elvaan minion.
#. column 9: Wind-up Elvaan
msgctxt "Item:24000:0:2"
msgid "wind-up Elvaan"
msgstr "Заводные эльвааны"

#. ja: ミニオン修得<br>伝説のエルヴァーンを模した魔法人形
#. de: Diese detaillierte Puppe wurde einem legendären Elvaan nachempfunden.<br><br>Benutze diesen Gegenstand, um die Elvaan-Marionette zu rufen.
#. fr: [Mascotte]<br>Une poupée à l'effigie d'un Elvaan, membre d'un peuple légendaire.
#. column 0: wind-up Elvaan
#. column 2: wind-up Elvaan
#. column 9: Wind-up Elvaan
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:24000:0:8"
msgid "Remarks relating to a certain people's perpetually dour facial expressions are best kept to oneself.<br><br>Use item to acquire the wind-up Elvaan minion."
msgstr "Замечания о вечно хмурых лицах одного народа лучше оставить при себе.<br><br>Используйте предмет, чтобы получить заводного эльваана."

