#. ja: パンプキンクッキー2018
#. de: Kürbiskeks[p] 2018
#. fr: biscuit citrouille 2018
#. column 2: ripe pumpkin cookies MMXVIII
#. column 8: A devilish imp is thought to have made this slightly burnt biscuit shaped like a pumpkin head. One can only wonder what ingredients it contains─but whatever they are, they've somehow managed to go off despite having been baked.
#. column 9: Ripe Pumpkin Cookie MMXVIII
msgctxt "Item:24186:0:0"
msgid "ripe pumpkin cookie MMXVIII"
msgstr "спелое тыквенное печенье MMXVIII"

#. de: Kürbiskekse[p] 2018
#. fr: biscuits citrouille 2018
#. column 0: ripe pumpkin cookie MMXVIII
#. column 8: A devilish imp is thought to have made this slightly burnt biscuit shaped like a pumpkin head. One can only wonder what ingredients it contains─but whatever they are, they've somehow managed to go off despite having been baked.
#. column 9: Ripe Pumpkin Cookie MMXVIII
msgctxt "Item:24186:0:2"
msgid "ripe pumpkin cookies MMXVIII"
msgstr "спелое тыквенное печенье MMXVIII"

#. ja: パンプキンヘッドを模したクッキー
#. de: Ein unheimlich leckeres Gebäck in Form eines Kürbisses.
#. fr: Un biscuit en forme de tête de citrouille. Quel sourire maléfique<nbsp>!
#. column 0: ripe pumpkin cookie MMXVIII
#. column 2: ripe pumpkin cookies MMXVIII
#. column 9: Ripe Pumpkin Cookie MMXVIII
msgctxt "Item:24186:0:8"
msgid "A devilish imp is thought to have made this slightly burnt biscuit shaped like a pumpkin head. One can only wonder what ingredients it contains─but whatever they are, they've somehow managed to go off despite having been baked."
msgstr "Считается, что это слегка подгоревшее печенье в форме тыквенной головы испёк бесёнок. Остаётся только гадать, что он туда положил. Но что бы это ни было, оно успело испортиться, несмотря на выпечку."

#. ja: パンプキンクッキー2018
