#. ja: 異才クラン員の手記
#. de: Clan-Jägerkoryphäe-Tagebuch
#. fr: journal de prodige
#. column 2: peerless Clan mark logs
#. column 8: A list of highly elite marks documented by the log's owner. Said owner may never have slain the marks, but he did achieve a remarkable level of detail in his entries─by unabashedly hiding in the bushes to observe the grisly deaths met by his fellow hunters. Though such documents were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up and they are now essentially worthless.
#. column 9: Peerless Clan Mark Log
msgctxt "Item:24805:0:0"
msgid "peerless Clan mark log"
msgstr "журнал непревзойдённого охотника на метки клана"

#. de: Clan-Jägerkoryphäe-Tagebücher
